OLED Display → Main Board (ESP32)
● GND (Black Wire) → GND (Ground)
● VCC (Red Wire) → 3V3
● SCL (Green Wire) → D22
● SDA (Orange Wire) → D21

Touch Sensor → Main Board
● Top Pin / GND (Black Wire) → GND (Ground)
● Middle Pin / Signal (Blue Wire) → D25
● Bottom Pin / VCC (Red Wire) → 3V3

Buzzer → Main Board
● Positive (+) (Orange Wire) → D4
● Negative (-) (Black Wire) → GND (Ground)

Push Buttons → Main Board
● Button 1 (Left) Top Pin (Orange Wire) → D27
● Button 2 (Right) Top Pin (Green Wire) → D14
● Both Buttons' Bottom Pins (Black Wire) → GND (Ground)
